# Empty: requests hit relative /api/... paths, proxied to the formera-api
# Cloud Run service by the Firebase Hosting rewrite in firebase.json.
# This keeps the frontend and backend same-origin from the browser's
# perspective, so auth cookies aren't subject to third-party cookie
# blocking (Safari ITP, Chrome/Firefox tracking protections, etc.) the way
# they were when the API lived on a separate *.run.app origin.
VITE_API_URL=
